2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: pumping-power term (Tusek et al. 2013 Eqs. 5-7) DOES reproduce a genuine
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: interior COP optimum vs. packed-bed sphere diameter and parallel-plate
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: spacing in this repo's own model (Step 3-4) -- confirming the paper's
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: qualitative finding, which the pre-Phase-7 model structure could not show
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: even in principle (Step 1). Doing this required fixing mdot at a
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: representative value rather than re-optimizing it per geometry as the paper
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: does, because Step 2 found that free COP-only optimization is itself
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: degenerate in this repo's 2nd-law magnetic-work model (pushes mdot, and Qc
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: with it, toward zero) -- a genuine, separate limitation, stated rather than
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: papered over.
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: The specific optimum found here (packed-bed COP-optimal: 0.5mm;
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: parallel-plate COP-optimal: 0.1mm) should NOT be expected to match
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: the paper's Table 3 (0.17mm packed-bed / 0.075mm parallel-plate) exactly:
2026-08-16 22:30:13 [INFO   ] main: this repo's operating point (291K/10K span, 2kg, 1Hz, 1.5T, fixed
