2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: first_order_mce.py separately notes this model's lattice-only C_lattice
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: denominator (no latent-heat correction) is inappropriate for a first-order
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: transition. Both effects point the same way and appear to compound here.
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: This model should NOT be refit to match Giguere's direct DeltaT_ad instead --
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: doing so would abandon its documented calibration to the peak DeltaS_M literature
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: value, and this 0-D lattice-only-C_p framework cannot simultaneously match both
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: (that would require resolving the transition's latent heat, which honesty flag #1
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: already flags as out of scope for this model). Instead: DeltaT_ad predictions from
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: this module should be treated as upper-bound-ish, roughly 2-2.5x optimistic vs. a
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: direct measurement at the one field/composition point checked here, and any
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: downstream design conclusion (e.g. cascade.py's graded-cascade capacity/COP numbers)
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: that depends on this module's DeltaT_ad should be read with that correction in mind
2026-08-16 22:34:41 [INFO   ] main: (see core.first_order_mce.composition_tuned_material's apply_giguere_correction flag).
